WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.373 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Signal is your free first gate into Numinous.

00:00:04.373 --> 00:00:06.997 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
This is a preview of the work,

00:00:06.997 --> 00:00:09.620 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
not a receipt or proof of access.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.962 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
To enter, choose The Signal through Whop.

00:00:14.962 --> 00:00:17.502 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Afterwards, sign in to the same

00:00:17.502 --> 00:00:19.618 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
account and check its library.

00:00:19.618 --> 00:00:22.580 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
This storefront cannot grant access by itself.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.516 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Signal stays free.

00:00:26.516 --> 00:00:29.168 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
No card is required, and no recurring

00:00:29.168 --> 00:00:31.820 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
charge begins when you enter this gate.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.414 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Dispatches is where the record begins.

00:00:37.414 --> 00:00:41.438 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Follow announcements and upcoming realms there, then return whenever a

00:00:41.438 --> 00:00:45.060 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
new vision calls your attention back to the work.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.556 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The First Vision is an entry reading for this world.

00:00:52.556 --> 00:00:55.046 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
It introduces the chambers and gives you

00:00:55.046 --> 00:00:57.891 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
a place to begin before you explore the

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.380 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
rooms available in your verified Whop library.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.635 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The rooms are a map, not a

00:01:06.635 --> 00:01:09.271 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
promise that this browser has unlocked them.

00:01:09.271 --> 00:01:11.906 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Signal begins in the open; other

00:01:11.906 --> 00:01:14.541 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
spaces follow different parts of the work.

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:17.930 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
In the Realm, a new being comes into view.

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:20.942 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Stay with its atmosphere and story, and check

00:01:20.942 --> 00:01:24.330 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
your Whop account for the rooms available to you.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:34.908 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Process turns toward the craft behind the vision.

00:01:34.908 --> 00:01:38.381 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Records keep its names, context and story.

00:01:38.381 --> 00:01:41.421 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Together they make an image something you

00:01:41.421 --> 00:01:44.460 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
can return to rather than scroll past.

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.392 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Session is a moment for questions

00:01:49.392 --> 00:01:51.783 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
and the next turn of the work.

00:01:51.783 --> 00:01:54.517 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Field Journal is space for your own

00:01:54.517 --> 00:01:57.250 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
notes as you follow what each vision becomes.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:06.222 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Sanctuary is a shared space around the gates.

00:02:06.222 --> 00:02:09.086 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Travellers can return to the work there and

00:02:09.086 --> 00:02:11.950 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
make room for one another's questions and discoveries.

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:15.530 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The calendar marks the rhythm of future realms and announcements.

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:17.678 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Follow it at your own pace.

00:02:17.678 --> 00:02:20.900 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
No other purchase is needed to keep The Signal.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:32.113 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
When you are ready, choose the free Signal gate below.

00:02:32.113 --> 00:02:34.581 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
After Whop confirms your entry, read

00:02:34.581 --> 00:02:37.049 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the First Vision and check Dispatches.

00:02:37.049 --> 00:02:40.340 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
A return page is never proof of access.
